  "description": "Test 5. Date 2026-01-01 (D1 = 2025-12-01, so a month coalesce over [2016-01-01, 2025-12-01] turns the October points into (2025-10-01, 1) and leaves November, the last group). Keys 1, 3, 5 unlimited, 2 and 4 with maxCount 2. SimNewDay before SimNewYear does nothing. After SimNewYear (state 1) each SimNewDay thins the next unlimited series in key order (perPass = 5/365 + 1 = 1; limited series are skipped without counting): day 1 key 1 (cursor 2), day 2 key 3, day 3 key 5 (still running), day 4 reaches the end: state 0 and false; day 5 true. SimNewYear during a pass changes nothing. With 400 series perPass = 400/365 + 1 = 2: one call thins keys 1000 and 1001; with a timer that moves 5 ms per reading one call thins one series and returns false (counter 1), the next thins one more and returns true (counter 0). No series: the pass ends at once. Another state: true, nothing.",
